        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: the researcher who conducted the Terre Haute prison experiments\n- Projects: the Terre Haute prison experiments, the Tuskegee syphilis study\n- Places: Terre Haute, Montgomery\n- Concepts: untreated syphilis observation\n\nFacts:\n- The researcher conducted the Terre Haute prison experiments.\n- The same researcher was involved in observing the natural progression of untreated syphilis in rural African-American men in Montgomery.\n- The observation project referenced was the Tuskegee syphilis study.",
